### VS Code REST Client requests.
### API_KEY is read from a local .env file (gitignored) via {{$dotenv API_KEY}} —
### never paste a real key into this file; it is committed to a public repo.

### Get a Jira ticket locally
GET http://localhost:7071/api/ticket/TEST-1
x-api-key: {{$dotenv API_KEY}}

### Test missing auth (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/ticket/TEST-1

### Test invalid ticket (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/ticket/INVALID-99999
x-api-key: {{$dotenv API_KEY}}

### Add a comment to a ticket (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/ticket/TEST-1/comment
x-api-key: {{$dotenv API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Posted via jira-gateway."
}

### Add a comment without auth (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/ticket/TEST-1/comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Posted via jira-gateway."
}
